# docs/20 B4 regression (U5, U8, U16, U19, U22; from the review's refute_urgent_order,
# s15_offline_boot, s19_stale_offline and fm07_nosd). Before: the R and L tiles read as
# single keys (D1 made them Opt); the hint said "按住 G0 说一段" (talk at once, losing the
# first 0.65 s); idle sessions two days old held the one urgent card; unplugged, home said
# "都处理完了" with a live-looking Mando and ages that kept growing; with no SD card home
# still offered 开会 and G0. Now: Opt+R / Opt+L keycaps; "G0按住，看到●REC再说"; waiting
# first, then the newest idle, marked 空闲, the day-old ones folded into "+N 更早";
# offline a faded Mando, "现在离线" and "离线 · N 分钟前的情况" with stopped ages; no card:
# 开会 greyed and the hint says why.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
shot online  Opt+R / Opt+L tiles; G0: wait for ● REC
host sessions.snapshot {"rev":6,"total":3,"sessions":[{"sid":"bb000001","slot":2,"name":"旧的支付重构","kind":"tty","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":180000},{"sid":"bb000002","slot":1,"name":"刚做完的录音修复","kind":"tty","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":120},{"sid":"bb000003","slot":1,"name":"昨天下午的文案","kind":"bg","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":18000,"short":"d4e5f6"}]}
wait 3500
shot idle-newest  idle: the newest first, 空闲, the 2-day one folded
host sessions.snapshot {"rev":7,"total":2,"sessions":[{"sid":"bb000001","slot":2,"name":"旧的支付重构","kind":"tty","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":180000},{"sid":"bb000004","slot":2,"name":"上周的迁移","kind":"tty","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":700000}]}
wait 3500
shot only-older  only day-old idle ones: folded, not urgent
host sessions.snapshot {"rev":8,"total":2,"sessions":[{"sid":"8d3e7a19","slot":1,"name":"支付回调重试","kind":"tty","st":"waiting","need":true,"age_s":540},{"sid":"bb000001","slot":2,"name":"旧的支付重构","kind":"tty","st":"idle","need":true,"age_s":180000}]}
wait 3500
shot waiting  waiting first, +1 older on the right
usb off
wait 540000
press opt+l
press enter
wait 300
shot offline-9m  unplugged 9 min: faded Mando, 现在离线, ages stopped
press opt+i
shot offline-inbox  the inbox says how old its list is
boot store=sd usb=off bat=4100
wait 1500
shot never  booted away from the Mac: 还没连上 Mac, no 0s
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
wait 1500
shot no-cpad  cable in, cpad not answering: what to run
boot store=internal usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
shot no-sd  no SD card: 开会 greyed, the hint says why
